{"last_link_id": 12, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [8], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [416.5289001464844, 385.12396240234375], "pos": [906.552978515625, 518.931640625], "widgets_values": ["minimal editorial poster, art book aesthetic, poetic scene illustration, contemporary poster, Japanese editorial design, Scandinavian minimalism, watercolor, soft gouache illustration, quiet luxury, refined print design。\n竖版海报，2:3比例，无边框，上下两部分分区构图。\n上半部分：保留原始参考照片，完整保留原图景物、物体、人物、环境、背景与构图，仅做轻微电影感调色，降低饱和度，保留自然光影与真实摄影质感，禁止HDR，禁止强锐化，禁止AI重绘改写实景内容。\n下半部分：完全参考上半部分实景内容，将画面景物、物体、人物、环境提炼成极简艺术插画，不做像素复刻，柔和概括、艺术化简化造型。\n插画质感：soft gouache, transparent watercolor, dry brush texture, subtle paper grain, hand‑painted illustration, matte printed texture。\n物体保留原图主色调、轮廓、数量、高低层次关系；线条简化为自然舒展的笔触色块；物件保留基础识别度，造型概括轻盈。\n大量米白色留白，构图疏朗平衡，氛围安静诗意，艺术书籍内页，独立杂志海报，博物馆印刷品质感。\n色彩：warm ivory, sage green, olive green, dusty pink, soft rose, terracotta, muted burgundy, lavender grey, powder blue, warm ochre, smoky brown。\n整体效果：real photography + poetic scene illustration，高级、克制、安静自然，纸张印刷质感，高分辨率，画面不出现任何文字。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [7, 9], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["", "3:2", false, 1715922253, "randomize", "2k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 11, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "im